{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game: Escape from the Pursuing Shadow \u2014 \u201cThe Doppel\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/Image_Sequence_006_1391.jpg?t=1746717986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The Doppel&quot; is a classic side-scrolling action game \u2014 but unlike most, it features only a single enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That enemy, Doppel, looks exactly like you and relentlessly chases you by perfectly mirroring your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As long as you remain in the light, Doppel will pursue you without end. But in the darkness, you are safe \u2014 the shadows will shield you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story: Facing Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/Image_Sequence_005_0085.jpg?t=1746717986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Doppel is the embodiment of fear, born from your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While hiding in the dark may offer temporary relief, you must ultimately outpace and overcome Doppel in order to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You, a novelist standing at the edge of despair, must confront your roots and face the fears buried deep within your heart as you flee from Doppel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Art: Minimal Pixel Graphics Using Only Two Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/Image_Sequence_006_1553.jpg?t=1746717986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every visual element in &quot;The Doppel&quot; is rendered using only two colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This minimalistic, low-resolution style evokes a sense of nostalgia and invites the player\u2019s imagination to fill in the world\u2019s details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711330?t=1746717986","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711330?t=1746717986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/f64177f648ae66cbf7cd26122f188bb2100087cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746717986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/f64177f648ae66cbf7cd26122f188bb2100087cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746717986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game: Escape from the Pursuing Shadow \u2014 \u201cThe Doppel\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/Image_Sequence_006_1391.jpg?t=1746717986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The Doppel&quot; is a classic side-scrolling action game \u2014 but unlike most, it features only a single enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That enemy, Doppel, looks exactly like you and relentlessly chases you by perfectly mirroring your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As long as you remain in the light, Doppel will pursue you without end. But in the darkness, you are safe \u2014 the shadows will shield you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story: Facing Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/Image_Sequence_005_0085.jpg?t=1746717986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Doppel is the embodiment of fear, born from your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While hiding in the dark may offer temporary relief, you must ultimately outpace and overcome Doppel in order to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You, a novelist standing at the edge of despair, must confront your roots and face the fears buried deep within your heart as you flee from Doppel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Art: Minimal Pixel Graphics Using Only Two Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/Image_Sequence_006_1553.jpg?t=1746717986\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every visual element in &quot;The Doppel&quot; is rendered using only two colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This minimalistic, low-resolution style evokes a sense of nostalgia and invites the player\u2019s imagination to fill in the world\u2019s details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Nerdrinkers"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/6ff0d7cbdfdfdce8fdb7b6f0bafe0a65197f7e8d/header.jpg?t=1746717986","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136891,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136891/movie480.mp4?t=1746717461","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136891/movie_max.mp4?t=1746717461"},"name":"PlayDemo 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136891/2847ee758faf41dc390e7c55ff9e3a861cfa6964/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746717461","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136891/movie480_vp9.web